---
import { RELAY_README, RENDEZVOUS_README } from "../data/links";
---

<section class="section" id="run" aria-labelledby="run-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="plate">
            <div class="section-grid">
                <div class="section-side">
                    <h2 id="run-title">Run your own</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-main">
                    <p class="section-lede">
                        Two containers, built from this repository. The relay carries the transfer
                        and its bandwidth bill. The rendezvous carries no file bytes.
                    </p>

                    <div class="run">
                        <div class="panel">
                            <div class="panel-head">
                                <span class="panel-label">relay</span>
                                <a class="panel-link" href={RELAY_README}>
                                    README
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <pre class="term" tabindex="0"><code>docker build -f docker/relay/Dockerfile -t sluice-relay docker
docker run -d --name relay -p 443:443 -p 80:80 -p 7842:7842/udp \
  -v "$PWD/certs:/etc/relay/certs:ro" sluice-relay</code></pre>
                        </div>

                        <div class="panel">
                            <div class="panel-head">
                                <span class="panel-label">rendezvous</span>
                                <a class="panel-link" href={RENDEZVOUS_README}>
                                    README
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <pre class="term" tabindex="0"><code>docker build -f docker/rendezvous/Dockerfile -t sluice-rendezvous docker
docker run -d --name rendezvous -p 7842:7842/udp \
  -v "$PWD/certs:/etc/rendezvous/certs:ro" sluice-rendezvous</code></pre>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="run-notes">
                        <li>
                            The relay starts closed. Add the endpoint ids that may relay through it
                            before a transfer will.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Both use UDP 7842. Give each its own host, or map a different port and
                            put that address in the ticket.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Both need a certificate. Each README lists the two files the image mounts
                            and the commands that make them.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
